{"2851700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nasty Zombies", "steam_appid": 2851700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead have arisen in endless waves. Step into the robes of a Hollow Monk, an ethereal warrior of unknown origin, driven by a singular, relentless purpose: to eradicate the <strong>Nasty Zombies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight solo or with up to 8 players, uncover hidden secrets, and unlock over 100 achievements. Master intuitive melee combat and a diverse arsenal of firearms, then enhance your abilities by unlocking <strong>Blessings, Miracles, &amp; Invocations</strong> between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've unlocked everything, <strong>Prestige</strong> to prove your mastery. Each <strong>Prestige</strong> level increases the number of <strong>Blessings</strong> you can equip at once, letting you create even deadlier loadouts. Climb the <strong>Leaderboards</strong>, competing for <strong>Highest Wave, Fastest Speedruns, and Top Prestige ranks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/6f6f90101a60b9e1f8e60c56ea2b5c10.webp?t=1787874409\" width=780 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/45e037a70692ed4b9c8c8a22e072469c.avif?t=1787874409\" width=616 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/0c668a09720ef3b3ec500afec1a49384.poster.avif?t=1787874409\" width=644 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/0c668a09720ef3b3ec500afec1a49384.webm?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/0c668a09720ef3b3ec500afec1a49384.mp4?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The classic wave-based zombie survival formula you know and love,</i><br><i>amped up with high-speed movement and a retro twist.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/68b42e5393dba7e05dcfc8d93506196e.poster.avif?t=1787874409\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/68b42e5393dba7e05dcfc8d93506196e.webm?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/68b42e5393dba7e05dcfc8d93506196e.mp4?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Master a fast-paced movement system where agility is your greatest weapon!</i><br><i>Harness the Kinetic Energy system, gaining increased firepower and melee speed as you stay on the move.</i><br><i>Leap over obstacles, slide under walls, and air dash to outmaneuver the undead!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/6f6f90101a60b9e1f8e60c56ea2b5c10.webp?t=1787874409\" width=780 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/b29c8d352eaec70b439b96c902eb2373.avif?t=1787874409\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/34a4ff6a2877c63b86e5d29d23e2d8f4.poster.avif?t=1787874409\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/34a4ff6a2877c63b86e5d29d23e2d8f4.webm?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/34a4ff6a2877c63b86e5d29d23e2d8f4.mp4?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Earn money by killing zombies, then spend it to increase your power through</i> <i><strong>Miracles</strong></i>, <i><strong>Blessings</strong></i><strong>, &amp; <i>Invocations</i></strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/e470c0d090e3f7a3856308b5516c628c.webp?t=1787874409\" width=193 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful temporary power-ups dropped by fallen zombies, granting unique effects to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are  <strong>10 Miracles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/a369fd72c386465234b67d9b73c21beb.avif?t=1787874409\" width=958 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/1bedf4963240aa5807dadcb404be343e.webp?t=1787874409\" width=206 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks that provide permanent upgrades and powerful passive bonuses to enhance your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>13 Blessings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/10dddbeb3ddb7aed266641a3320c0c48.avif?t=1787874409\" width=958 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/8276ae4d6570d3cda43ad1decdb595dd.webp?t=1787874409\" width=254 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful abilities that define your playstyle, allowing you to activate unique effects at will and build around your chosen path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>8 Invocations</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/8e74025fb23947296002b5c8de947e9b.avif?t=1787874409\" width=958 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/6f6f90101a60b9e1f8e60c56ea2b5c10.webp?t=1787874409\" width=780 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/8584ec4d86cb36298aa7602c40e05f2a.webp?t=1787874409\" width=274 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/dd74e3127bad1f2bcbb25a103f134e06.poster.avif?t=1787874409\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/dd74e3127bad1f2bcbb25a103f134e06.webm?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/dd74e3127bad1f2bcbb25a103f134e06.mp4?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Unlock new camos for your weapons by getting kills &amp; headshots.</i><br><i>The more zombies you eliminate, the more camos you unlock for your arsenal.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/6f6f90101a60b9e1f8e60c56ea2b5c10.webp?t=1787874409\" width=780 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/105346f53aa1b2b79cb377e74ad06650.avif?t=1787874409\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/491e4133729db28229670a7967546407.poster.avif?t=1787874409\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/491e4133729db28229670a7967546407.webm?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Track your stats and compete for your place on the global leaderboards.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead have arisen in endless waves. Step into the robes of a Hollow Monk, an ethereal warrior of unknown origin, driven by a singular, relentless purpose: to eradicate the <strong>Nasty Zombies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight solo or with up to 8 players, uncover hidden secrets, and unlock over 100 achievements. Master intuitive melee combat and a diverse arsenal of firearms, then enhance your abilities by unlocking <strong>Blessings, Miracles, &amp; Invocations</strong> between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've unlocked everything, <strong>Prestige</strong> to prove your mastery. Each <strong>Prestige</strong> level increases the number of <strong>Blessings</strong> you can equip at once, letting you create even deadlier loadouts. Climb the <strong>Leaderboards</strong>, competing for <strong>Highest Wave, Fastest Speedruns, and Top Prestige ranks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/6f6f90101a60b9e1f8e60c56ea2b5c10.webp?t=1787874409\" width=780 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/45e037a70692ed4b9c8c8a22e072469c.avif?t=1787874409\" width=616 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/0c668a09720ef3b3ec500afec1a49384.poster.avif?t=1787874409\" width=644 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/0c668a09720ef3b3ec500afec1a49384.webm?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/0c668a09720ef3b3ec500afec1a49384.mp4?t=1787874409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">